      "review_issues": [],
      "region_id": "determination-quote-one"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0089-b006",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "• Creatures with too much are unable to die (de - termination) • The being with the most \"Determination\" in the underground has the power to change fate and use the in-game save/load system",
        "raw": "• Creatures with too much are unable to die (de - termination)\n• The being with the most \"Determination\" in the underground has\nthe power to change fate and use the in-game save/load system",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.20234921,
          0.39315714,
          0.65412572,
          0.4402
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.20102594,
          0.39244286,
          0.655449,
          0.44127143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          17,
          18,
          19
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "• 体内这种物质过多的生物将无法死亡（de-termination，把词拆成“去除终结”）。\n• 地下世界中“决心”最强的存在，能够改变命运，并使用游戏内的存档／读档系统。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
