    {
      "id": "p0089-b007",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "I think there are a few words like this in JP, right? You'll have to strike a good balance between what's the best fit. But also, \"determination\" is an unusual word, and thus it's really increased the quotability of the save point line (\"It fills you with determination ... \") So if there's a way to get the meaning while also being a bit more iconic/quotable, go for that.",
        "raw": "I think there are a few words like this in JP, right? You'll have to strike\na good balance between what's the best fit. But also, \"determination\"\nis an unusual word, and thus it's really increased the quotability of the\nsave point line (\"It fills you with determination ... \") So if there's a way\nto get the meaning while also being a bit more iconic/quotable, go\nfor that.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.19236357,
          0.45223571,
          0.66524124,
          0.53977857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.1910403,
          0.45152143,
          0.66656451,
          0.54085
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          20,
          21,
          22,
          23,
          24,
          25
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "我记得日语里有几个类似的词，对吧？你得权衡一下，找出最合适的。不过，“决心”也是个不太常见的词，因此存档点那句“它使你充满了决心……”才变得特别容易被人记住和引用。所以，要是能找到既传达含义、又更有辨识度、更适合引用的说法，就用吧。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
